Laptop oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
A headless switch in the A.I.M. member page (inactive in the game) records the quote CanMercBeHired would play instead of
starting the video face and lets AimMemberHireMerc hire a given profile; the charge computation of DisplayMercChargeAmount
moves into CalcMercContractAmount (same code, same call site); the body of BtnIMPConfirmYes moves into IMPConfirmYes (same
code). Appends wrappers around the static helpers CalcCompetence, MercFilesHireMerc, SettleMercAccounts,
CalculateTotalPurchasePrice, PurchaseBobbyOrder, CalculateSoldiersInsuranceContractLength,
CompileQuestionsInStatsAndWhatNot and the I.M.P. confirm. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0009.

